usage: expanded_suite.py [-h] --work-dir WORK_DIR [--resume]
                         [--model-name MODEL_NAME] [--batch-size BATCH_SIZE]
                         [--eval-batch-size EVAL_BATCH_SIZE]
                         [--input-max-length INPUT_MAX_LENGTH]

Offline, isolated 5000-film suite; checkpoints remain under WORK/project.
Resume only reuses hash-verified complete stages. A failed/interrupted stage
requires a new work directory; this runner never overwrites its partial
output.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --work-dir WORK_DIR
  --resume
  --model-name MODEL_NAME
  --batch-size BATCH_SIZE
  --eval-batch-size EVAL_BATCH_SIZE
  --input-max-length INPUT_MAX_LENGTH
